description:
Design a Verilog module for a 5-bit binary up-counter with synchronous reset. If reset is high, the counter should reset to 5'b00000. Otherwise, it should count up by one.
module binary_up_counter (
    input clk,
    input reset,
    output reg [4:0] count
);

code:
module binary_up_counter (
    input clk,
    input reset,
    output reg [4:0] count
);always @(posedge clk) begin
        if (reset)
            count <= 5'b00000;
        else
            count <= count + 1;
    end

endmodule

