Implement the Verilog module based on the following description.
Build an 8-bit bidirectional shift register with synchronous active high reset signal and direction control signal.
// (1) reset: Resets the shift register to 8'b00000000.
// (2) dir: Direction control (1 for left, 0 for right).
// (3) d: Data input to be shifted in.
