description:
Design a circuit that operates as a three-input inverter followed by a three-input AND gate. The module takes a 3-bit input, inverts each bit, and then produces a single output that is HIGH only when all three inputs are LOW, effectively determining when the input is entirely zero.
module top_module(
    input [2:0] in,
    output out
);

